# SCRUBBED SAMPLE — not a runtime log, never written to by any service.
#
# Quote this when an example of the intake log is needed. The live
# logs/intake-service.log is untracked (see .gitignore) and must not be pasted
# into a document, a ticket or a report, even though its contents are synthetic.
#
# This shows the CURRENT shape. `summary=` is built by _intake_log_summary from
# an ALLOWLIST of exactly two keys — correlation_id and created_via — so no
# field added to the request schema later can widen it. Identifiers below are
# placeholders, not values any system ever emitted.

